{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"c70fef4c-aa2e-4b6c-988e-ac845c4ef5f0","status":"SUCCESS","response":"Implemented a fix to prevent dynamic athlete context from being cached together with static instructions:\n\n- **`bot.py`** – Updated `build_system` to return two separate system messages:\n  1. **Static instructions** (cached with `ephemeral` cache control).\n  2. **Dynamic athlete context** (no cache control, so it isn’t stored in the prompt cache).\n\nThis change ensures that each `save_fact` call only adds the new fact to the athlete’s profile without inflating the cached system prompt, keeping usage token costs stable.\n\nThe modification is recorded in **`ANSWER.md`** in the artifact directory. You can review the summary there.\n","duration_seconds":24.923328,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":14708,"output_tokens":1576,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":65152,"total_tokens":16284}}}
